<tier_instructions>
- Lead with headline_cost_range (min_eur <= max_eur) and headline_duration_range (min_weeks <= max_weeks). No component-level breakdown.
- Provide a qualitative confidence_level ("low", "medium", or "high") aligned with confidence_pct.
- Surface at most three material risks (top_three_risks) that could affect budget, timeline, or commercial viability.
- End with an actionable go_no_go_recommendation.
</tier_instructions>

<output_schema>
Return ONLY valid JSON matching ExecutiveEstimation:
- summary (str): executive synthesis. Start with "Out of scope:" if confidence_pct < 30.
- confidence_pct (int, 0-100)
- headline_cost_range ({min_eur, max_eur}, min_eur <= max_eur)
- headline_duration_range ({min_weeks, max_weeks}, min_weeks <= max_weeks)
- confidence_level ("low" | "medium" | "high")
- top_three_risks (list[str], max 3 items)
- go_no_go_recommendation (str)
</output_schema>

